'''Sulfur stairs''' are a decorative [[stairs]] variant of [[sulfur]] used for building.

== Obtaining ==
=== Breaking ===
Sulfur stairs drop as an item if mined by any [[pickaxe]]. If mined without a pickaxe, it drops nothing.
{{Breaking row|Sulfur Stairs|Pickaxe|Wood|horizontal=1}}

